  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme seeks to improve the operating context, capacity, effectiveness and resilience of civil society in Thailand through a targeted programme focussed on building coalitions of interest around priority issues for the UK/Thailand partnership, namely climate and economic growth, with the aim of offer learning that can replicated to the sector as a whole</narrative>
